  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 合作夥伴橫幅\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cBoSu8s.png\" alt=\"Logo\" />\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\" />\n</p>\n\n<!-- Social Links -->\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/TJc3CxR4jK\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@nightbeamstudio\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/MeherBenSalem\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nightbeamstudio/projects\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/organization/nightbeam\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <a href=\"https://nightbeam.gitbook.io/rpg-attribute-system/\">\n        <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=文件說明&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=read-the-docs&logoColor=white\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\">\n</p>\n\n![https://i.imgur.com/JnL1prm.png](https://i.imgur.com/JnL1prm.png)\n\n\n\n<!-- Ko-fi -->\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/nightbeamstudio\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5c14e387dab576fe667689cf/670f5a0171bfb928b21a7e00_support_me_on_kofi_beige.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<!-- Description -->\n<p style=\"text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:auto; font-size:16px;\">\n    一款輕量級的 RPG 風格進度模組，透過根據玩家等級提供可擴展的屬性來增強 Minecraft 的遊戲體驗。隨著玩家推進，生命值、傷害和耐力等關鍵數值會自動提升，創造出更具動態感且更有回報的升級體驗。\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>RPG 風格等級進度</strong> – 屬性會隨著玩家升級而自動擴展。</li>\n    <li><strong>動態屬性升級</strong> – 生命值、傷害、防禦、速度等數值會隨進度提升。</li>\n    <li><strong>自訂屬性系統</strong> – 完全重寫的數值邏輯，獨立於原版系統之外。</li>\n    <li><strong>可配置擴展</strong> – 可透過設定檔微調成長公式、倍率與需求條件。</li>\n    <li><strong>簡潔的 UI 指標</strong> – HUD 覆蓋層與工具提示會顯示數值變化與進度。</li>\n    <li><strong>重製道具與背景故事</strong> – 包含如 <em>重生捲軸</em> 等道具，用於重置數值。</li>\n    <li><strong>伺服器與客戶端相容</strong> – 在單人與多人模式中均可無縫運作。</li>\n    <li><strong>輕量且優化</strong> – 為效能而設計，將額外開銷降至最低。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\">\n</p>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7VVKSsj10kA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HkPJwSd.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\">\n</p>\n\n<h3><strong>需求</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Minecraft：</strong> 1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2, 1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.5</li>\n    <li><strong>載入器：</strong> NeoForge 或 Forge</li>\n    <li><strong>函式庫：</strong> JAUML</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting 合作夥伴橫幅\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n[bisect-banner]: https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/db9c3eef-25e8-4ac0-93b6-bf386644dcef.webp\n[bisect-link]: https://www.bisecthosting.com/nightbeam",
